<h1>Macro SpeedBar</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>View &gt; Show Macro SpeedBar</b></span> <span class="Path">or by pressing</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>F12</b></span><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>.</b></span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Show Macro SpeedBar</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command displays or hides the Macro SpeedBar dialog.</span></p>
<p>The <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Macro SpeedBar</b></span> dialog contains 10 customisable buttons per scheme. The number of schemes is unlimited.</p>
<p class="whs4"><img src="Images/Macro_SpeedBar.gif" width="167px" height="343px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB">10 User-defined buttons</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">When pressed every button</span> causes the macro assigned to that button to be executed.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Customise</b></span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Calls <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Setup Macro SpeedBar</i></span> dialog where user can change the names and the macros assigned to the buttons and to save them as different schemes.</p>
<p><img src="Images/Setup_Macro_SpeedBar.gif" width="486px" height="503px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
<ul class="whs7">
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Button Name</b></span> fields - name of the button for the current scheme.</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Macro</b></span> fields - macro assigned to the button for the current scheme.</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Schemes</b></span> group:</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Name</b></span> listbox - selects existing scheme.</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px; list-style:circle;" type="circle" class="kadov-p">
<p class="whs8"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Save As</b></span> button - saves the current scheme under different name.</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px; list-style:circle;" type="circle" class="kadov-p">
<p class="whs8"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Delete</b></span> button - deletes a scheme.</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px; list-style:circle;" type="circle" class="kadov-p">
<p class="whs8"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Clear All</b></span> button - clears the information for all buttons (all <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Button Name</b></span> and <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Macro</b></span> fields).</p>
</li>
<li style="margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Listbox</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- selects existing scheme with 10 user-defined buttons</span>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If you want to assign sequence of macros to a button simply save this sequence as a text file and assign the following macro:</p>
<p class="whs9">RunScript( FileName=“C:\MyScript.txt” )</p>
<p>to a button.</p>
<p>For details about macros refer to <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>KUBE Macros</b></span> section.</p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Macro SpeedBar</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to define custom shortcut buttons.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
